              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, throwing spear, javelins and shield. Army General. May ride a horse (+8) in which case the shield is discarded. Stealth if on foot.</characteristic>
