              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Tribesmen have hand weapon, javelins and shield. Open Order. May have light armour (+2) and throwing spear (+2), and may upgrade to large shield (+1). One unit may upgrade to WS4, Drilled (+4) as elite troops.</characteristic>
